BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Tacos\, Halloween Trivia & Tunes w/ DJ MadCat at Brick\, Corning
DTSTART:20261027T200000Z
DTEND:20261028T030000Z
DTSTAMP:20261026T160519Z
UID:b91c967722e433bb42c07b24c6faebd8b14ac9f1@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Music,Games
DESCRIPTION:Halloween Week at Brick means Tacos\, Trivia & a little extra 
 chaos.\nThis Tuesday\, MadCat Team Trivia is getting a spooky twist. You
 ’ll still get the usual mix of random questions\, but we’re tossing in
  some Halloween madness along the way because regular trivia felt a little
  too well-behaved.\nMadCat Team Trivia • 7–9 PM\n4 rounds • FREE to 
 play • Gift certificate prizes every round • Season points toward the 
 grand prize\nMax 6 players per team\nExpect the usual trivia mix plus some
  random Halloween surprises worked into the night. Nothing too serious\, n
 othing too predictable\, and probably at least one question that makes the
  whole table yell\, “HOW DID WE NOT KNOW THAT?!”\nTuesday-only taco sp
 ecials\nBeef Tacos\nShrimp Po’ Boy Tacos\nBrick House Tacos — smoked b
 risket\, pulled pork\, or chicken\nOctober cocktail specials are still pou
 ring\, so grab something spooky while you play.\nKaren’s behind the bar 
 until 11 PM\nCalvin’s in the kitchen until 9 PM\nWhen trivia wraps at 9
 \, you take over the soundtrack. Send in your requests\, pick the vibe\, a
 nd keep the Halloween-week fun going.\nBring your team\, bring your appeti
 te\, and maybe bring your best useless Halloween knowledge. This week\, it
  might actually save you.\n#BrickCorning #TacosTriviaTunes #MadCatTeamTriv
 ia #TriviaNight #HalloweenWeek #TacoTuesday #CorningNY #MadCatMediaWorks\n
 \nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78486403/2
 0261027160000
GEO:42.151266;-77.061011
LOCATION:Brick\, 1 West Pulteney Street\, Corning\, New York\, 14830\, Uni
 ted States
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78486403/20261027160000
END:VEVENT
