BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Haunted History in Downtown Ithaca
DTSTART:20261029T220000Z
DTEND:20261030T010000Z
DTSTAMP:20261026T160519Z
UID:ff7c31571169f8fd4d64227f14b17810087c1c68@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:History & Heritage
DESCRIPTION:Event by The History Center in Tompkins County\n110 North Tiog
 a Street within the Tompkins Center for History & Culture\, Ithaca\, NY\nP
 ublic\nDowntown Ithaca has seen its share of murder\, disaster\, and thing
 s nobody ever quite explained. On this walking tour\, guides .Sherri La To
 rre and Ben Sandberg and a cast of costumed volunteers take you past the l
 andmarks where real crimes and tragedies left their mark on the city. You'
 ll hear true stories of murder\, jealousy\, and insanity pulled straight f
 rom The History Center's archives\, and come face to face with some of the
  most haunted items in our collection.\nWhat: 75 minute walking tour over 
 sidewalks\, gravel paths\, and grass - with a slight incline.\nWhere: The 
 History Center in Tompkins County\, 110 N Tioga St\, Ithaca NY 14850\nWho:
  This tour is designed for ages 16-116\nWhen:\nTWO TOURS PER DATE:\n* Tour
  1 is 6pm-7:15pm\n* Tour 2 is 7:30-8:45pm\nWear Comfortable Shoes\, Bring 
 an Umbrella\, Jacket\, and Water Bottle\nWeather - this tour takes place r
 ain or shine! In case of severe weather\, we’ll determine cancellations 
 by 10:30 am the morning-of.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time
 .ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78493688/20261017180000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78493688/20261017180000
END:VEVENT
