DESCRIPTION:Event by Finger Lakes Rail Experience\n210 W Williams St\, Wat
 erloo\, NY\nPublic\nALL HALLOWS EVE TRAIN\n• Welcome pour of local spark
 ling wine\n• Souvenir glass\n• Charcuterie served in each car\n• Hal
 loween bar trivia\n• Costume contest with a shot for the winner\n• Tar
 ot readings in Premium Class\n• Candy\, likely distributed through super
 natural means\nAs the sun slips below the Finger Lakes\, the All Hallows
 ’ Evening Club departs Waterloo for a spirited two-hour round trip fille
 d with tricks\, treats\, and a touch of the supernatural.\nThe evening beg
 ins with a small pour of local sparkling bubbly served in a souvenir glass
 . As the train rolls into twilight\, guests can enjoy a charcuterie spread
  in each car\, test their knowledge during Halloween bar trivia\, and orde
 r spooky cocktails from the onboard bar.\nCostumes are highly encouraged\,
  and all guests will be entered into our onboard costume contest.\nGuests 
 traveling in Premium Class will also be invited to have their fortunes exp
 lored during an onboard tarot reading.\nThe train features a curated selec
 tion of restored mid-century passenger cars with Premium and First Class a
 ccommodations. Coach seating is not offered\, preserving the intimate\, ad
 ults-only atmosphere of our traditional Evening Club experience.\nAddition
 al wine\, beer\, cocktails\, and other beverages will be available for pur
 chase. There will be no dessert service on this excursion\, but candy is w
 ill be copious.\nPricing is identical to our regularly scheduled Evening C
 lub trains.\nTickets: https://flxrailexperience.com/all-hallows-evening-cl
