DESCRIPTION:Event by The Shoe Inn\n10 town line rd\, Van Etten\, NY\nPubli
 c\nSOMETHING WICKED THIS WAY COMES…\nHALLOWEEN NIGHT AT THE SHOE INN!\nT
 he witches are brewing\, the spirits are rising\, and the drinks are calli
 ng! Get ready for a SPOOKTACULAR night of music\, costumes\, and Halloween
  fun!\nFRIDAY\, OCTOBER 30TH\nLIVE MUSIC | 8 PM – 11 PM\nCOSTUME CONTEST
 !\nCome dressed to impress (or TERRIFY!) for your chance to win a BOOs BAS
 KET!\nWill you be a witch\, a vampire\, a zombie\, or something straight o
 ut of your worst nightmare? The more creative\, the better!\nGather your g
