BEGIN:VEVENT
SUMMARY:Coldbrook Curse @ Bradley Farms
DTSTART:20261031T230000Z
DTEND:20261101T020000Z
DTSTAMP:20261026T160519Z
UID:644fe816896455e3c68ae3abbb4924cc0426bd49@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
DESCRIPTION:Event by The Coldbrook Curse at Bradley Farms and Bradley Farm
 s\nBradley Farms\n1543 Maple Ave\, Elmira\, NY\nDuration: 3 hr\nPublic\nHi
 dden deep in a forgotten valley lies the ruins of Coldbrook Creek — a on
 ce-thriving village swallowed by silence and shadow.\nOver a century ago\,
  the townsfolk turned on a strange old woman named Granny J Hatchet. They 
 blamed her for every misfortune: illness\, livestock deaths\, and the myst
 erious disappearance of a child.\nOne cold October night\, they dragged he
 r from her cabin… tied her to the great tree in the square… and burned
  her alive.\nBut before the flames took her\, she cursed them all:�“Yo
 u’ll vanish like smoke… and when you return… you’ll wear your sins
  on your skin…”\nBy sunrise\, the village was empty.\nFires still burn
 ed. Meals sat untouched. But every man\, woman\, and child… had vanished
 .\nNow\, each October\, the cursed souls return.\nTwisted and rotted\, the
 ir skin peels like wax. Their mouths filled with ash and shattered teeth. 
 They walk the ruined streets — trapped between life and death.\nIn the L
 ower Hollow\, nothing grows. The ground breathes. Zombies stagger through 
 the blackened soil… blind\, starving\, and restless.\nOn the darkest nig
 hts\, their screams still echo through the mist.\nAnd each October… the 
 gates of Coldbrook Creek open again.\nStep into the curse. Walk the haunte
 d streets and take aim on the Zombies. �Face what still lingers in the f
 og… if you dare.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0u
 zpj/event/78495953/20261023190000
STATUS:CONFIRMED
URL:https://calendar.time.ly/o9b0uzpj/event/78495953/20261023190000
END:VEVENT
