 des a mask\, it MUST be removed for ID verification.\nNo ID = No Entry. No
  exceptions.\nGrab your costume\, round up your people and let’s make th
 is the Halloween party of the year.\nBrick • Corning\, NY\nSaturday\, Oc
 tober 31\nKira & The Kindness • 9 PM–12 AM\n#BrickCorning #NightOfTheL
 ivingGroove #KiraAndTheKindness #HalloweenAtBrick #HalloweenParty #Costume
