DESCRIPTION:The Fixers Collective meets on Saturdays from 3:00 pm – 5:00
  pm at their NEW location\, the Cayuga ReUse Center (2309 N. Triphammer Ro
 ad)\, and is open to anyone who has things to fix\, wants to help fix item
 s\, and/or wants to learn how to repair items. It is an informal and fun g
 athering of folks who want to prolong the lifespan of household items such
