UID:1cc7db0ddf6550b974271760b169f9e7970fdc09@corning-events
SEQUENCE:0
CATEGORIES:Holidays,Wine
DESCRIPTION:Event by Keuka Lake Wine Trail\, Vineyard View Winery and Weis
  Vineyards\nKeuka Lake Wine Trail\nPublic\nJoin us for Handcrafted Holiday
  along the Keuka Lake Wine Trail\nSaturday\, November 14\, 2026 | 10:00 AM
  – 5:00 PM\nGather your favorite people and kick off the holiday season 
 on beautiful Keuka Lake in the Finger Lakes.\nThis intimate event is more 
 than a wine tasting. It's an immersive experience celebrating the artistry
 \, passion\, and craftsmanship behind every bottle. Travel along a custom 
 itinerary to six participating wineries\, where you'll enjoy unique behind
 -the-scenes experiences that go beyond the tasting room.\nAlong the way\, 
 savor four wine samples and a holiday-inspired food pairing at each winery
 \, thoughtfully curated by Lake Life Catering.\nParticipating Wineries:\n
 • Keuka Spring Vineyards\n• Agricolae Estate Winery by Ravines\n• We
 is Vineyards\n• Domaine LeSeurre Winery\n• Heron Hill Winery\n• Vine
 yard View Winery\nYour ticket includes:\nA unique tasting experience at si
 x wineries\nA custom event itinerary\nFour wine samples and a holiday-insp
 ired food pairing at each stop\nAn opportunity to discover the stories and
  people behind Keuka Lake wines\nWhether you're stocking up for holiday ga
 therings or simply looking for a cozy pre-winter day in the Finger Lakes\,
  Handcrafted Holiday is the perfect way to raise your spirits and toast th
 e season.\nTickets are limited and sold by starting winery. Reserve your s
 pots early!\nTickets: https://www.keukawinetrail.com/handcrafted-holiday?f
 bclid=IwY2xjawVCsVxleHRuA2FlbQIxMABwZG9mBXNydGMGYXBwX2lkEDIyMjAzOTE3ODgyMD
 A4OTIAAR7Kngrsyche-wiQxNJHQ0h6F0q-j377JsN96LnWzTZg44EaaqoWVmKEccPUUw_aem_N
 6qJ-vI4sfJle8DFEPwEKg.\n\nSource: FLXcalendar - https://calendar.time.ly/o
 9b0uzpj/event/78493736/20261114100000
